@GosubResetWitchBook Path:System/System_ResetWitchBook Version:4

@BeginIf Expression:isDebugDirectJump
    @Gosub Path:Act02_Chapter04/Act02_Chapter04_TrialInit
    @HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Duration:0 Reset:true
    @ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay

@SetTrialTimer Time:900
@HideUI UINames:ControlPanel AllowToggle:false
@ShowUI UINames:DebateUI

@SetBadId CommonBadEndId:8

; ==============================================================================
; MARK: 9-7: 💬 死体はどこにあったのか
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論シーン9-7 死体はどこにあったのか
; 議論開始エフェクト
; BGM変更：HirO（Voなし）
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_37_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_37_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge9-7-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Determined_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:犯人は２人を殺したあと、<br>エレベーターの天井裏に<br>レイアの死体を置いた。|#0204Trial07_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Determined_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そしてエマの死体は<br>エレベーターに体重が<br>かからないようにして<br>同じく天井裏の空間に<br>設置しておいたんだ。|#0204Trial07_Hiro002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Determined_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:先に上に昇った３人が<br>エレベーターから降りた後、<br>犯人はその仕掛けを作動させて<br>エマを落下させたとしたら……。|#0204Trial07_Hiro003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Determined_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それなら<br>私の見たことと<br>全てが一致するよ。|#0204Trial07_Hiro004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR3,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Glare_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:で、でも<br>天井裏の空間を調べたけど、<br>エマちゃんを<br>吊るせるものなんて<br>なかったよ……！？|#0204Trial07_Miria001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"それにヒロさんの推理には、<br>【<link=\"Objection_02_04_07_01\">自動で落とせる仕掛け</link>】<br>も必要になりますよね。|#0204Trial07_Sherry001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"ハンナさんが浮遊の魔法で<br>エマさんの死体を<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_07_02\">持ち上げていた</link>り<br>しない限り、<br>無理なんじゃないでしょうか？|#0204Trial07_Sherry002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:わ、わたくし<br>エレベーターの上になんて<br>いませんでしたわ！？<br>ちゃんと上の階で<br>待ってましたもの！|#0204Trial07_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"誰かが何かしたとしたら……<br>えーと……<br>きっとそこの怪力女が<br>何かしたんですわ！<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_07_03\">規格外の力</link>で！！|#0204Trial07_Hanna002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR7,ArmL4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:面白い発想ですね！<br>主張の意味は<br>よくわかりませんけど！|#0204Trial07_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆皮肉げ/呆れ

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR9,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"橘が死体で<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_07_04\">お手玉</link>でもしてたってのか？<br>そりゃすげーな。|#0204Trial07_Alisa001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そんなことしても、<br>すぐ落ちてきて<br>意味がないと思いますけどね。|#0204Trial07_Sherry004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:けどもしも<br>本当に死体が<br>そこにあったと言うなら、<br>アリサさんだって<br>容疑者の１人に<br>なりますからね？|#0204Trial07_Sherry005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ああ？<br>んだと？|#0204Trial07_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"たとえば<br>炎を使って<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_07_05\">浮かび上がるもの</link><br>なんかを作ったのかも<br>しれません！|#0204Trial07_Sherry006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それなら<br>時間差で落ちてくるのも<br>納得ですよね！|#0204Trial07_Sherry007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open04
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:いい加減なこと<br>言ってんじゃねーぞ……！<br>ウチを疑うってなら<br>証拠でも見せてみな！|#0204Trial07_Alisa003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Glare_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:と、特にそんな痕跡は<br>なかったと思うけどな……。|#0204Trial07_Miria002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……はっ。<br>そもそも<br>【死体がエレベーターに<br>入る方法】が<br>問題だったんだろ？|#0204Trial07_Alisa004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"なら、<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_07_06\">死体でも操った</link>んじゃ<br>ねーか？|#0204Trial07_Alisa005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:おめえたしか、<br>【入れ替わり】が<br>できるんだろ。<br>佐伯よう……。|#0204Trial07_Alisa006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:えっ！？|#0204Trial07_Miria003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_02_04_07_07\">体を交換</link>して動かす……<br>その可能性は<br>否定できねーだろ。|#0204Trial07_Alisa007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Confused_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そっ、<br>そんなことしてないよ……！|#0204Trial07_Miria004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:はっ……<br>どーだかな。|#0204Trial07_Alisa008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


